#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "never"
msgstr "zange"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Results are missing or stale. Check the primary poller and DOCTOR log for startup, timeout, or persistence errors."
msgstr "Iziphumo zilahlekile okanye ziphelelwe lixesha. Khangela i-poller eyintloko kunye nelogi ye-DOCTOR ukuba kukho iimpazamo zokuqalisa, zokuphelelwa lixesha, okanye zokugcinwa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "A completed diagnostic run is recent; this does not mean all checks passed."
msgstr "Uqhutywo lovavanyo olugqityiweyo lolwakutshanje; oku akuthethi ukuba lonke uvavanyo luphumelele."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor alert state is invalid. Restore doctor_alert_pending from backup before retrying."
msgstr "Imo yesilumkiso ye-Doctor ayisebenzi. Buyisela i-doctor_alert_pending kwi-backup phambi kokuzama kwakhona."

