msgid "Approval expires after five minutes and is invalidated by a changed filesystem. The acting account must be able to create directories or change owner permissions."
msgstr "Imvume iphelelwa emva kwemizuzu emihlanu kwaye iyacinywa yisistim yefayile etshintshiweyo. Iakhawunti esebenzayo kufuneka ikwazi ukudala ulawulo okanye ukutshintsha iimvume zomnini."

