#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Email Addresses"
msgstr "Iidilesi ze-imeyile zeZilumkiso"

#: setup.php
msgid "Comma-separated addresses to email when a check starts or stops failing. Leave empty to only log changes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Iidilesi ezahlulwe ngekoma zokuthumela i-imeyile xa uvavanyo luqala okanye luyeka ukusilela. Shiya kungenanto ukurekhoda kuphela iinguqu kwilogi ye-Cacti."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert on Warnings"
msgstr "Lumkisa ngeZilumkiso"

#: setup.php
msgid "Also alert when a check moves into or out of a warning."
msgstr "Kwakhona thumela isaziso xa uvavanyo lungena okanye luphuma kwisilumkiso."

#: setup.php
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Imida"

#: setup.php
msgid "Poller Run Time Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Isilumkiso seXesha lokuSebenza kwePoller (ipesenti)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the last main-poller run used this share of the polling interval. Runs that take the whole interval always fail."
msgstr "Lumkisa xa ukusebenza kokugqibela kwepoller ephambili kusebenzise esi sabelo sexesha lovavanyo. Imisebenzi ethatha lonke ixesha ihlala isilela."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Isilumkiso seSithuba esiSimahla kwiDiski ye-RRA (ipesenti)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Lumkisa xa isithuba esivulekileyo kwinkqubo yeefayile ze-RRA sihla ngaphantsi kwale pesenti."

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Silela xa isithuba esivulekileyo kwinkqubo yeefayile ze-RRA sihla ngaphantsi kwale pesenti."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Failure (percent)"
msgstr "Ukusilela kweSithuba esiSimahla kwiDiski ye-RRA (ipesenti)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Warning (seconds)"
msgstr "Isilumkiso sokuTenxa kweWotshi (imizuzwana)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Lumkisa xa iiwotshi zedathabheyisi neze-PHP zahluka ngokungaphezulu koku."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Failure (seconds)"
msgstr "Ukusilela kokuTenxa kweWotshi (imizuzwana)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Silela xa iiwotshi zedathabheyisi neze-PHP zahluka ngokungaphezulu koku."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRD Stale Intervals"
msgstr "Amaxesha e-RRD engaHlaziywanga"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn after this many collection intervals without a file update (1 to 100)."
msgstr "Lumkisa emva kwala maxesha mangaka okuqokelela ngaphandle kohlaziyo lwefayile (1 ukuya ku-100)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Additional disk-write delay for external caching (0 to 86400). Boost adds its own allowance."
msgstr "Ulibaziseko olongezelelweyo lokubhala kwidiski lokugcina kwikheshe yangaphandle (0 ukuya ku-86400). I-Boost yongeza esayo isabelo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Deferred RRD Write Allowance (seconds)"
msgstr "Isabelo sokuBhala i-RRD okuLityazisiweyo (imizuzwana)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Isilumkiso soBungakanani beLogi yeCacti (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Lumkisa xa ilogi yeCacti ikhula ngaphaya kobu bungakanani, nto leyo edla ngokuthetha ukuba ukujikeleziswa kwelogi akusebenzi."
